vent": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JmUGVjia6gMhvDYWJL6CwA", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53200, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JmUGVjia6gMhvDYWJL6CwA", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54489, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019xbLC4uzxThPK9KXbBMwdh", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54789, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019xbLC4uzxThPK9KXbBMwdh", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54789, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019xbLC4uzxThPK9KXbBMwdh", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 58660, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and healthy again. A SEV2 incident (INC-0001) is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The latest deploy, v2.3.1, and its release candidate v2.3.1-rc both failed health checks.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1.\n- Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I retried once and it finished. All three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) are now on v2.3.0.\n- The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate. Opening it pages the on-call engineer.\n- It describes what happened, the partial rollback and retry, and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the deployment-system error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DnxJ8JPoTu11uZ6tGyUU7S", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MumEBuqbaaKPkMGdtDAZpH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015BmrHxjYrxCjZAK5544Fmk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ArLwWE3xYs4RLpyWjTCKjJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Xe5bsDiPVw9BCuZFQeWyii", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017L1nBSSPA4MdyVBZDoT6RB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01U9f41Di6kn