inished. All three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) are now on v2.3.0.\n- The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate. Opening it pages the on-call engineer.\n- It describes what happened, the partial rollback and retry, and two follow-ups: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and look into the deployment-system error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}